  "section_summary": "This section implements core infrastructure libraries for database access, caching, and analytics. It includes singleton clients for Supabase and Upstash Redis with a custom circuit breaker pattern, services for persisting user session and progress state, and telemetry utilities to track AI model performance and application errors. These foundational tools enable robust data operations, fault tolerance, and observability throughout the application."
